{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coziest Cat Decorating Adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world where warmth, charm, and creativity come together \u2014 a delightful home decorating game filled with fluffy cats, soft colors, and endless cozy vibes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this heartwarming experience, your goal is simple yet irresistibly satisfying:<br>place each piece of furniture and every adorable cat in just the right spot to bring each room to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From snug little bedrooms to elegant living spaces and sunny balconies, every level offers a brand-new scene waiting for your personal touch. Arrange, decorate, and create harmony between home and cat \u2014 because a perfect room isn\u2019t complete without a purring friend!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time, relax, and let your creativity flow. Whether you\u2019re a design lover, a cat enthusiast, or just someone who enjoys calm, feel-good moments \u2014 this game is made to warm your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe0 Beautiful, hand-crafted rooms full of charm and personality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 Adorable cats with unique poses and personalities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 A gentle puzzle twist \u2014 place each object where it truly belongs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc96 Soothing music and cozy visuals for the ultimate relaxing vibe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your dream cat home \u2014 one cozy room at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110570?t=1762220256","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4110570?t=1762220256","capsule_image":"https:/